  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CI Post 2015 Working Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The MDGs set out in 2000 are due to expire in 2015. There is currently an international process of discussing, influencing and negotiating for a successor global development framework. This project seeks to strengthen the Catholic voice in the post 2015 development agenda through a CI international post 2015 working group. By engaging CI members on the creation of the post-2015 process, members will be better able to ensure that governments and other important actors deliver on their commitments. While the Post 2015 Agenda is a very broad agenda with multiple actors, it is vital for a strong faith-based voice to influence the debate and ensure the views of the poor and marginalised are represented.</narrative>
  </description>
